  "vEzvGYvTVqOO61bynXpyQ": {
    "id": "vEzvGYvTVqOO61bynXpyQ",
    "client_name": "Davi Emerick",
    "client_cpf": "145.155.666-79",
    "client_email": "daviemericko01@gmail.com",
    "client_phone": "(31) 9226-7220",
    "contract_html": "\n        <div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; padding: 40px !important; max-width: 800px !important; margin: 0 auto !important; color: #333333 !important;\">\n          <header style=\"text-align: center !important; margin-bottom: 40px !important; border-bottom: 3px solid #2c3e50 !important; padding-bottom: 20px !important;\">\n            \n            <h1 style=\"color: #2c3e50 !important; margin: 0 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 28px !important;\">CONTRATO DE PRESTAÇÃO DE SERVIÇOS</h1>\n            <p style=\"color: #333333 !important; margin-top: 10px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Protocolo: <strong>CONT-1768318193496-TI6JB582C</strong></p>\n          </header>\n          \n          <section style=\"margin-bottom: 30px !important;\">\n            <h2 style=\"color: #333333 !important; border-bottom: 2px solid #2c3e50 !important; padding-bottom: 10px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CONTRATANTE</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\"><strong>Nome:</strong> Davi Emerick</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\"><strong>CPF:</strong> 145.155.666-79</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\"><strong>Email:</strong> daviemericko01@gmail.com</p>\n            <p style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\"><strong>Telefone:</strong> (31) 92267-220</p>\n          </section>\n          \n          <section style=\"margin-bottom: 30px !important;\">\n            <h2 style=\"color: #333333 !important; border-bottom: 2px solid #2c3e50 !important; padding-bottom: 10px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CLÁUSULAS CONTRATUAIS</h2>\n            \n      <h3 style=\"font-weight: bold !important; margin-top: 25px !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; color: #333333 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CLÁUSULA PRIMEIRA - DO OBJETO</h3>\n      <p style=\"text-align: justify !important; line-height: 1.6 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\">O presente contrato tem por objeto a prestação de serviços conforme especificações acordadas entre as partes, em conformidade com a legislação brasileira vigente.</p>\n    \n      <h3 style=\"font-weight: bold !important; margin-top: 25px !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; color: #333333 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CLÁUSULA SEGUNDA - DO PRAZO</h3>\n      <p style=\"text-align: justify !important; line-height: 1.6 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\">Este contrato terá vigência de 12 (doze) meses a partir da data de assinatura, podendo ser renovado mediante acordo entre as partes.</p>\n    \n      <h3 style=\"font-weight: bold !important; margin-top: 25px !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; color: #333333 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CLÁUSULA TERCEIRA - DAS OBRIGAÇÕES</h3>\n      <p style=\"text-align: justify !important; line-height: 1.6 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\">As partes se comprometem a cumprir fielmente todas as condições estabelecidas neste instrumento, sob pena de rescisão contratual e aplicação das penalidades cabíveis.</p>\n    \n      <h3 style=\"font-weight: bold !important; margin-top: 25px !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; color: #333333 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CLÁUSULA QUARTA - DA CONFIDENCIALIDADE</h3>\n      <p style=\"text-align: justify !important; line-height: 1.6 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\">As partes se obrigam a manter sigilo sobre todas as informações confidenciais a que tiverem acesso em razão deste contrato, em conformidade com a Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados (LGPD).</p>\n    \n      <h3 style=\"font-weight: bold !important; margin-top: 25px !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; color: #333333 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CLÁUSULA QUINTA - DO FORO</h3>\n      <p style=\"text-align: justify !important; line-height: 1.6 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\">Fica eleito o foro da comarca de São Paulo/SP para dirimir quaisquer dúvidas oriundas do presente contrato.</p>\n    \n          </section>\n          \n          \n      <div style=\"margin-top: 50px !important; padding-top: 30px !important; border-top: 2px solid #2c3e50 !important;\">\n        <h2 style=\"color: #333333 !important; font-weight: bold !important; margin-bottom: 20px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">ASSINATURA ELETRÔNICA</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\">Este contrato foi assinado eletronicamente em <strong>13/01/2026, 12:31</strong></p>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\"><strong>Método de autenticação:</strong> Reconhecimento Facial</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 30px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 16px !important; color: #333333 !important;\"><strong>Nível de segurança:</strong> Verificado com Segurança</p>\n        \n        <div style=\"margin-top: 30px !important; padding: 30px !important; border: 2px solid #2c3e50 !important; text-align: center !important; max-width: 400px !important; margin-left: auto !important; margin-right: auto !important; background-color: #fafafa !important;\">\n          <p style=\"font-family: 'Brush Script MT', 'Segoe Script', 'Bradley Hand', cursive !important; font-size: 32px !important; color: #2c3e50 !important; margin: 0 0 10px 0 !important; line-height: 1.2 !important;\">Davi Emerick</p>\n          <div style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #2c3e50 !important; width: 250px !important; margin: 0 auto 15px auto !important;\"></div>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0 !important; font-weight: bold !important; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; color: #333333 !important;\">Davi Emerick</p>\n          <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 !important; color: #333333 !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important;\">CPF: 145.155.666-79</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n          \n          <footer style=\"margin-top: 50px !important; padding-top: 20px !important; border-top: 1px solid #ddd !important; text-align: center !important; color: #333333 !important; font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; font-size: 12px !important; opacity: 0.8 !important;\">Documento gerado eletronicamente</footer>\n        </div>\n      ",
